588 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 254 0 R
/E (Standard LinearSVC outputs uncalibrated decision function scores \(distance to hyperplane\) rather than true probabilities. Wrapping LinearSVC inside CalibratedClassifierCV \(Platt Scaling\) transforms raw scores into well-calibrated posterior probabilities, making the 0.70 confidence threshold mathematically meaningful.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
